        "settingsDefault": "Follow game",
        "note": "Delivered only while the car's gearbox is manual. TransmissionMode Sequential or H-pattern forces manual; Automatic never delivers; Follow game delivers only while the game's own transmission option is manual. A writer applying a Sequential profile sets TransmissionMode=Sequential."
