        "settingsKey": "TransmissionMode",
        "settingsValues": [
          "Sequential",
          "H-pattern"
        ],
        "settingsDefault": "Follow game",
        "note": "Same gearbox rule. No gate held is neutral; reverse wins a shared gate; a gate outside the current car's gear ratios is ignored, never clamped. Only reverse and gear1-gear8 select a gear (neutral alone selects nothing), so a writer sets TransmissionMode=H-pattern only for an H-pattern profile with one of them bound, and writes no gate when two gates share one control."
      }
